      "name": "Chakra-Fuelled Link",
      "category": "chakra",
      "cost": "1 Chakra",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Act as a pure, lossless thermal/kinetic source for a Sympathetic binding for 1 round, bypassing the need for a fire or the risk of Binder's Chills."
    },
    {
      "name": "Precision Throw",
      "category": "chakra",
      "cost": "1 Chakra",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Curve a thrown kunai/dagger around half or three-quarters cover, granting Advantage on the attack roll."
    },
    {
      "name": "Setting a Binding",
      "category": "sympathy",
      "cost": "Bonus Action",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Bonus action to set up, whatever the link quality. Roll an Alar check: d20 + INT + proficiency, plus WIS when focused (lost if you took damage or were grappled since your last turn; advantage after a calm round of preparation). DC by link: Perfect 8, Good 11, Poor 15. A failure means slippage and a partial effect, not a miss. A binding acting on a person lets them save against your Sympathy DC. Maintaining it is free but occupies your one mental split. Shares your bonus action with Body Flicker."
    },
    {
      "name": "Link Efficiency",
      "category": "sympathy",
      "cost": "",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Perfect Link (same piece of matter): DC 8, ~80-90%. Good Link (similar material, or blood/hair for organic targets): DC 11, ~40-60%. Poor Link (crude similarity): DC 15, ~5-15%, high slippage."
    },
    {
      "name": "Binder's Chills",
      "category": "sympathy",
      "cost": "",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Drawing heat from your own body requires a CON save (DC 10 + energy level) or take 1d4 cold damage and 1 level of Exhaustion."
    },
    {
      "name": "Sneak Attack (1d6)",
      "category": "trait",
      "cost": "1 / turn",
      "status": "active",
      "description": "Extra 1d6 damage when hitting with a Finesse/Ranged weapon with Advantage, or when an ally (or an active Sympathetic kinetic binding distracting the target) is within 5 ft. of the enemy."
    },
    {
      "name": "Uchiha Dormancy (Sharingan)",
